{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリンピックで感動している和田です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れ日本"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、仕事や部活勉強など毎日暑いなかおつかれさまです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントくださったかた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も読ませていただきましたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにもーーーうれしーきもちっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、全国キャンペーンがはじまりましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日\n広島☆岡山\n14日\n名古屋Zeppライブ\n15日\n香川☆徳島\n16日\n高知☆愛媛\n17日\n山口"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に私はいきますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんよければ来てねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ来てくださった方は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『お好み村』や『原爆ドーム』\nそして『宮島』\n倉敷は『美観地区』\nなどに足を運んでみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も家族と行ったりしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮島はかわいーシカサンが一杯だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違えてもシカセンベイ食べないでねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日はトマトおねぇちゃんとずっといました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー観察もしたよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵書いたりしたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでねっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマト！いや、ヤマポテトおねぇーちゃんの方は凄く寝やすかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐにグースカピーピー寝てしまったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら写メを撮ってないので次に期待してください！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は初ライブ大阪にてありますねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初ライブは皆で出たかったけど、名古屋で頑張りまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪メンバーがんばってーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お盆はどんな過ごし方ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/2006418/0013.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}